                <note rend="inline" type="source">767.68119T&amp;M/7: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Special Mission at Lausanne</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-11-27T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 27,
                                1922—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>12. For Ambassador Child:</p>
                <p>Mission’s 19 and 22, November 25, 3 p.m. and 25, 11 p.m. President Harding and I
                    strongly approve your statement which was timely and appropriate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
